Summary: Add pkg-config input file for libsepol
Keywords: 

In Debian, dpkg compiles  in libselinux statically -- in order to prevent
dependency loops. Now, as libselinux acquired a build time dependency on
libsepol, automated dpkg builds failed -- since there was no  way for
packages to detect the transitive dependencies when linking
statically. This patch fixes that issue -- by generatinf a .pc file to be
used with pkg-config.

  pkg-config --static --libs libselinux
